# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Android TWA (android-twa/) — the Gradle project is generated fresh by
# GitHub Actions (`bubblewrap update`) from twa-manifest.json on every
# build, so twa-manifest.json is the only file that belongs in git here.
# Everything else (generated Gradle project, build output, the signing
# keystore) is never committed and never deployed to Infomaniak (only
# dist/ is, via the FTP workflow).
android-twa/*
!android-twa/twa-manifest.json

